      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "gu_self_strength"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Many Gu Immortals hold offensive killer moves even without offensive Immortal Gu. Fang Yuan’s myriad self is an offensive killer move whose core is cleanse soul Immortal Gu, a support Immortal Gu for soul path cultivation.",
